[00:00.00]Good morning, Grandma!|早上好，奶奶！
[00:05.76]Good morning, my dear.|早上好，亲爱的。
[00:08.44]Where are you going?|你要去哪儿？
[00:10.68]I'm going to feed the chickens.|我去喂鸡。
[00:13.70]Can I come with you?|我可以跟你一起去吗？
[00:15.56]Of course. Come with me.|当然，跟我来。
[00:20.28]Wow! There are so many chickens!|哇！好多鸡呀！
[00:23.62]Yes, they are hungry this morning.|是啊，它们今天早上饿了。
[00:27.08]They look very hungry.|它们看起来好饿。
[00:29.40]Let's feed them.|我们来喂它们吧。
[00:31.56]Let me help you, Grandma.|我来帮你，奶奶。
[00:33.50]All right. Throw the food gently.|好。轻轻地撒食物。
[00:37.02]Look, Grandma. They are eating.|你看，奶奶。它们在吃呢。
[00:39.54]Yes, they look happy.|是啊，它们看起来很开心。
[00:44.00]Wow. Hello, little chick.|哇。你好呀，小鸡。
[00:48.38]Yes, it's very small. Be gentle with it.|是啊，它很小。对它温柔点。
[00:52.92]It's so cute.|它好可爱。
[00:56.12]I love them, Grandma.|我喜欢它们，奶奶。
[00:58.80]They like you too.|它们也喜欢你。
[01:01.22]I'm so happy.|我好开心。
[01:03.70]Grandma, look! There are so many eggs!|奶奶，你看！好多鸡蛋呀！
[01:06.56]Yes, the hens lay eggs every day.|是啊，母鸡每天都下蛋。
[01:10.64]Every day?|每天吗？
[01:11.76]Yes, we have six hens here.|对，我们这儿有六只母鸡。
[01:15.58]Let's collect the eggs.|我们把蛋捡起来吧。
[01:18.66]Grandma, can I hold one?|奶奶，我可以拿一个吗？
[01:21.40]Of course. Hold it carefully.|当然，小心拿着。
[01:28.80]The eggs are still warm.|鸡蛋还是热的呢。
[01:30.90]Yes, they are fresh from the nest.|是啊，刚从窝里拿出来的，很新鲜。
[01:34.00]Shall we go make breakfast now?|我们现在去做早饭好吗？
[01:36.50]Yes, Grandma.|好的，奶奶。
[01:39.54]What kind of egg do you like, sweetheart?|你喜欢吃什么样的蛋，宝贝？
[01:42.82]I like fried eggs, Grandma.|我喜欢煎蛋，奶奶。
[01:47.10]Okay, I'll make fried eggs for you.|好，我给你煎蛋。
[01:51.48]Can I help you?|我可以帮忙吗？
[01:53.40]Sure. Bring me the bowl, please.|当然，把碗递给我。
[01:58.80]Breakfast smells so good.|早饭好香呀。
[02:03.54]Fresh eggs always smell nice.|新鲜的鸡蛋总是很香。
[02:07.14]I love mornings with you, Grandma.|我喜欢跟你一起度过的早晨，奶奶。
[02:10.44]I love you too, sweetheart.|我也爱你，宝贝。
